# Spellcaset Project Knowledge Base

## What This Game Is

A browser-based, turn-based spell-casting game built with React + Three.js. The player is a wizard who faces 21 levels of fantasy opponents. Spells are created by combining elements (Infinite Craft style: drag element chips onto each other in a workspace). Combined results are dragged into a cast zone to attack, heal, buff, or debuff. Bosses unlock new base elements; normal foes only use spells the player could also make.

## Tech Stack

- **Vite** -- fast dev server + bundler
- **React 18** -- component-based UI
- **@react-three/fiber + drei** -- Three.js 3D canvas layer (arena, particles, spell effects)
- **Zustand** -- lightweight state management
- **Framer Motion** -- UI animations (panels, transitions, floating numbers)
- **Fonts**: Cinzel (headings), Inter (body)

