## Architecture

### Render Layers
- **Layer 0**: Three.js canvas (3D arena, particles, spell projectiles with per-type colors/trails)
- **Layer 1**: React HTML overlay (combat UI, workspace, sidebar, overlays)

### Performance
- Drag system uses refs + requestAnimationFrame for ghost position (zero re-renders during drag)
- Combat delays reduced to 280-450ms for snappy feel

### Visual Effects
- 3D spell projectiles with colored trails per type (fire=orange, heal=green, buff=blue, debuff=purple)
- Impact burst particles (20 particles expanding outward)
- Camera shake on damage impact
- Dynamic lighting flash per spell type
- Floating damage/heal numbers (Framer Motion)
- Panel shake on hit, green glow on heal
- Cinematic encounter intro with portrait reveal

## Running The Game

```
npm install
npm run dev      # http://localhost:5173
npm run build
```
